### Lemma C18.1 (exact area and perimeter)

For `0<theta<=pi/3`,

\[
\boxed{
\operatorname{area}(K_\theta)
=
\frac{2\pi}{3}-\frac{\sqrt3}{2}-\frac\theta2,
}
\tag{C18.5}
\]

and

\[
\boxed{
\operatorname{per}(K_\theta)
=
\frac{4\pi}{3}-\theta.
}
\tag{C18.6}
\]
